# SSS-PROFILE p4: the screen pass - a skin profile scatters light on screen. Test object = CONTRACT §9 Q7: the
# Lee Perry-Smith head scan (CC BY 3.0, Infinite-Realities; docs licence record) in Projects/Desert/Content/Meshes/Test,
# material M_Skin_SSS (SubsurfaceProfileSurface, profile Materials/Subsurface/Skin.dsssprofile = UE skin defaults),
# put on Starter's Metal_40 sphere entity; the sun turned to light it from the side.
# A DirectionLightComponent takes its travel direction from its TRANSLATION (Scene.cpp:815), Rotation is ignored: -100,-50,0 = from +X, 27 deg up.
# The .deimport beside the glb was written by the editor (Content Browser > Reimport), not by hand.
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано set 106508827693059193 StaticMeshComponent.MeshHandle assets:Meshes/Test/LeePerrySmith.stmesh
Дано set 106508827693059193 StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/M_Skin_SSS.demat
Дано run Entity Metal_40
Дано --subject selection set Scale 0.03,0.03,0.03
Дано run Entity Sun
Дано --subject selection set Translation -100,-50,0
# Starter is authored unitless: Sun 1 lux under a Model-0 sky at EV100 0.53, so the sky alone lit the skin near white and
# the sun term was invisible (p7 bisect: sphere, head, metal alike; CastShadows off changed nothing). A key light needs lux + exposure:
Дано set 13376537502658031226 DirectionalLightData.Intensity 1000
Дано set 17921165617746467452 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.ManualExposureEV100 8.5
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -70,62,-432
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Когда set 17921165617746467452 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.SubsurfaceScattering true
Тогда-вид 0_wide framing only: the whole bust, side-lit from +X (at ~0.04 cm/px the physical skin's red mean free path is ~1 px, so bleed is judged in the close-up below)
# Close-up as UE's skin demos are judged: the nose at the terminator. The near plane is 10 cm (kDefaultNearPlane), so the
# camera stays ~20 cm off the nose and narrows the lens instead: horizontal FOV 30 deg -> ~10.7 cm across, ~0.0075 cm/px.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -70,63.6,-432
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 30
Тогда-вид 1_skin_on soft red-tinted light bleed at the terminator and around nose/ears; specular highlights stay sharp
Когда set 17921165617746467452 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.SubsurfaceScattering false
Тогда-вид 2_skin_off same view, hard Lambert terminator, no other change
Когда set 17921165617746467452 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.SubsurfaceScattering true
Когда set 17921165617746467452 PostProcessVolumeData.Settings.SubsurfaceScale 4
Тогда-вид 3_scale4 wider bleed, no haloes onto the background, no banding
